Topic Decay

Topics lose weight over time unless re-mentioned.

Recent/high-frequency topics should dominate ambiguous reference resolution.

Chunk Context Carryover

Each chunk should inherit:

recent active topics
unresolved entities
semantic aliases
prior inferred systems

This prevents chunk resets from destroying continuity.

Semantic Inference Layer

Separate:

raw transcript
semantic interpretation
final operational summary

Example:

Raw:
“that tool”

Semantic:
“Waypoint utility account creation tool”

Operational Summary:
“Users lack consistent permissions visibility for utility account creation workflows in Waypoint.”

